msgid "Start face scan"
msgstr "Bandá kosala scanner ya elongi"

#: src/onboarding.py:559 src/onboarding.py:613
msgid "Scan face model"
msgstr "Modèle ya elongi ya scanner"

#: src/onboarding.py:563
msgid "Can't save face model"
msgstr "Ekoki ko sauver modèle ya elongi te"

#: src/onboarding.py:568 src/onboarding.py:624
msgid "Scan second model"
msgstr "Scan modèle ya mibale"

#: src/onboarding.py:572
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "Ekokaki ko enregistrer modèle ya mibale te"

#: src/onboarding.py:572
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. Make sure your"
" face is well lit and centred, then try again -- or skip and add a mod"
"el later from Settings."
msgstr ""
"Modèle na yo ya liboso ebombami, yango wana login ya elongi esalaka dé"
"jà. Sala que elongi na yo ezala na mwinda malamu mpe ezala na centre, "
"sima meka lisusu -- to sauter mpe bakisa modèle moko sima uta na Param"
"ètres."

#: src/onboarding.py:607
msgid "Add a face model (required)"
msgstr "Bakisa modèle ya elongi (esengeli) ."

#: src/onboarding.py:609
msgid ""
"Face login needs at least one face model, so this scan can't be skippe"
"d. Record it in the light you usually sit in. Lighting changes how you"
"r face looks to the camera, so consider adding a second model later fr"
"om Settings, recorded in different light (for example evening lamps in"
"stead of daylight)."
msgstr ""
"Login ya elongi esengeli ata modèle moko ya elongi, yango wana scanner"
" oyo ekoki ko sauter te. Enregistrer yango na lumière oyo ofandaka min"
"gi.Mwinda ebongoli ndenge elongi na yo emonanaka na caméra, yango wana"
" kanisá kobakisa modèle ya mibale na sima uta na Paramètres, enregistr"
"é na lumière différente (ndakisa ba lampes ya soirée na esika ya lumiè"
"re ya moyi)."

#: src/onboarding.py:618
msgid "Add a second face model (recommended)"
msgstr "Bakisa modèle ya elongi ya mibale (recommandé)"

#: src/onboarding.py:620
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved. Lighting changes how your face looks to the"
" camera: a model recorded in daylight can fail in the evening under la"
"mps (or the other way round), and Ubuntu Hello then times out instead "
"of unlocking. A second model recorded in different light keeps recogni"
"tion reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Modèle na yo ya liboso ebombami. Mwinda ebongoli ndenge elongi na yo e"
"monanaka na kamera: modèle oyo ezwamaki na pole ya moi ekoki kozanga n"
"a mpokwa na nse ya miinda (to na ngambo mosusu), mpe Ubuntu Hello na n"
"sima esilisaka ntango na esika ya kofungola. Modèle ya mibale oyo ekom"
"ami na pole ekeseni esalaka ete reconnaissance ezala fiable na ngonga "
"nionso ya mokolo."

#: src/onboarding.py:622
msgid ""
"Change the lighting first: switch the room light or desk lamp on or of"
"f, turn away from the window, or put on the glasses you sometimes wear"
". Then look straight into the camera and press Scan."
msgstr ""
"Bobongola liboso mwinda: fungola to boma mwinda ya shambre to mwinda y"
"a mesa, longola lininisa, to tyá ba lunettes oyo olati ntango mosusu. "
"Na nsima, talá mbala moko na kati ya kamera mpe finá Scan."

#: src/onboarding.py:660
msgid "Ubuntu Hello Setup"
msgstr "Ubuntu Hello Bobongisi"

#: src/onboarding.py:673
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware a"
"nd tools..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ekoki ko débloquer automatiquement {} na yo na kosalelaka"
" authentification ya elongi (portefeuille détecté: {}).\n\n<b>Ezalela "
"ya TPM:</b> Kotala matériel mpe bisaleli ya TPM..."

#: src/onboarding.py:693
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. "
"Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ekoki ko débloquer automatiquement {} na yo na kosalelaka"
" authentification ya elongi (portefeuille détecté: {}).\n\n<b>Ezalela "
"ya TPM:</b> Matériel ya TPM ezwami. Kotia <i>tpm2-tools</i> na ndenge "
"ya automatique..."

#: src/onboarding.py:705
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active"
". Your password will be securely sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ekoki ko débloquer automatiquement {} na yo na kosalelaka"
" authentification ya elongi (portefeuille détecté: {}).\n\n<b>Ezalela "
"ya TPM:</b> Matériel TPM 2.0 ezali kosala. Mot de passe na yo ekokanga"
"ma malamu na kati ya TPM."

#: src/onboarding.py:707
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, "
"but automatic installation of <i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo"
" apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Falling back to software-based credent"
"ial caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ekoki ko débloquer automatiquement {} na yo na kosalelaka"
" authentification ya elongi (portefeuille détecté: {}).\n\n<b>Ezalela "
"ya TPM:</b> Matériel ya TPM ezwami, kasi botiami ya automatique ya <i>"
"tpm2-tools</i> elongi te. Tambwisa <code>sudo apt installation tpm2-to"
"ols</code>. Kozonga sima na caching ya ba credentiels basé na logiciel"
"."

#: src/onboarding.py:709
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detecte"
"d. Using software-based credential caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ekoki ko débloquer automatiquement {} na yo na kosalelaka"
" authentification ya elongi (portefeuille détecté: {}).\n\n<b>Ezalela "
"ya TPM:</b> Matériel ya TPM ezwami te. Kosalela caching ya ba credenti"
"els oyo esalemi na logiciel (AES-256-GCM)."

