#: src/main.glade:471
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring "
"or KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the "
"TPM when available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only ma"
"ster key. Face auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwal"
"let5 depending on your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Activer authentification ya elongi mpo na ko débloquer automatiquement"
" clé ya bokɔti na yo to KWallet na bokɔti. Yango ebombaka malamu mot d"
"e passe na yo ekangami na TPM soki ezali, to e chiffré na AES-256-GCM "
"na kosalelaka fungola ya masta ya misisa kaka. Face auth etie PAM_AUTH"
"TOK pona pam_gnome_keyring to pam_kwallet5 selon bureau na yo."

