#: src/onboarding.glade:62
msgid "Setup is done!"
msgstr "Setup esalemi!"

#: src/onboarding.glade:81
msgid ""
"We're done! Ubuntu Hello is now active on this computer. Try doing any"
"thing you would normally have to type your password for to authenticat"
"e, like running a command with sudo. If you enabled keyring auto-unloc"
"k, your login keyring or KWallet will also be unlocked automatically o"
"n login.\n\nYou can open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator later on to cha"
"nge more advanced settings or add additional models. Press Finish belo"
"w to close this window and open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator. "
msgstr ""
"Tosilisi! Ubuntu Hello ezali sikoyo activé na ordinateur oyo. Meká kos"
"ala eloko nyonso oyo olingaki normalement kokoma mot de passe na yo mp"
"o na ko authentiquer, lokola kosala commande na sudo. Soki o activer a"
"uto-déverrouillage ya ba clés, clé ya login to KWallet na yo eko déver"
"rouiller pe automatiquement na login.\n\nOkoki kofungola Configurateur"
" Ubuntu Hello sima mpo na kobongola ba paramètres ya likolo to kobakis"
"a ba modèles ya kobakisa. Finá Silisa na nse mpo na kokanga lininisa o"
"yo mpe kofungola Configurateur Ubuntu Hello."

#: src/onboarding.glade:129
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your login keyring or KWallet us"
"ing face authentication, preventing password prompts after logging in."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ekoki ko débloquer automatiquement clé ya bokɔti na yo to"
" KWallet na kosalelaka authentification ya elongi, kopekisa ba prompts"
" ya mot de passe sima ya kokota."

#: src/onboarding.glade:141
msgid "Enable automatic keyring/KWallet unlocking"
msgstr "Activer clé automatique/KWallet déverrouillage"

#: src/onboarding.glade:183
msgid "Confirm password"
msgstr "Confirmer mot de passe"

#: src/onboarding.glade:215
msgid "Setting a certainty policy"
msgstr "Kobongisa politiki ya bondimi"

#: src/onboarding.glade:234
msgid ""
"Because of changes in angles, distance, and other factors a face match"
" is never exactly the same as the stored face model. On this page you "
"can set how strict Ubuntu Hello should be."
msgstr ""
"Na ntina na mbongwana ya ba angles, distance, mpe makambo mosusu match"
" match ya elongi ezalaka jamais exactement ndenge moko na modèle ya el"
"ongi oyo ebombami. Na page oyo okoki ko setting ndenge nini Ubuntu Hel"
"lo esengeli ezala strict."

#: src/onboarding.glade:273
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "Noki"

#: src/onboarding.glade:289
msgid ""
"Allows more fuzzy matches, \nbut speeds up the scanning process greatl"
"y."
msgstr ""
"Epesi nzela na ba matchs flou mingi, . \nkasi esalaka ete mosala ya sc"
"anner esalaka nokinoki mpenza."

#: src/onboarding.glade:328
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "Ezali na bokatikati"

#: src/onboarding.glade:344
msgid ""
"Still relatively quick detection, \nbut might not log you in when furt"
"her away."
msgstr ""
"Encore détection relativement noki, . \nkasi ekoki kozala ete okɔta na"
" site te ntango ozali mosika."

#: src/onboarding.glade:383
msgid "Secure"
msgstr "Libateli"

#: src/onboarding.glade:399
msgid ""
"The slightly safer option, \nbut will take much longer to authenticate"
" you"
msgstr ""
"Option oyo ezali mwa libateli, . \nkasi ekozwa ntango molai mingi mpo "
"na kondimisa yo"

#: src/onboarding.glade:442
msgid "Adding a face model"
msgstr "Kobakisa modèle ya elongi"

#: src/onboarding.glade:461
msgid ""
"To authenticate you Ubuntu Hello needs to save a model of your face to"
" recognise you. Press the Scan button below to start the facial scan."
msgstr ""
"Pona ko authentiquer yo Ubuntu Hello esengeli o sauver modèle ya elong"
"i na yo po a reconnaître yo. Finá butɔ Scan oyo ezali awa na nse mpo n"
"a kobanda kosala scanner ya elongi."

#: src/onboarding.glade:538
msgid "Skip for now"
msgstr "Salá koleka mpo na sikoyo"

#: src/onboarding.glade:544
msgid ""
"You can add more face models later from Settings or with: sudo ubuntu-"
"hello add"
msgstr ""
"Okoki kobakisa ba modèles ya elongi mosusu sima uta na Paramètres to n"
"a: sudo ubuntu-hello add"

#: src/onboarding.glade:577 src/onboarding.glade:668
msgid "Configuring webcam"
msgstr "Kobongisa webcam"

#: src/onboarding.glade:594
msgid "Is the infrared emitter flashing ?"
msgstr "Est-ce que émetteur infrarouge ezali ko clignoter ?"

#: src/onboarding.glade:612
msgid "yes"
msgstr "Iyo"

#: src/onboarding.glade:629
msgid "no"
msgstr "Te"

#: src/onboarding.glade:687
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello will search your system automatically for any available c"
"ameras, so make sure your webcam is connected. After detection a list "
"of usable webcams will be shown. Pick the one you want to use and clic"
"k Next."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ekoluka na système na yo automatiquement ba caméras nions"
"o oyo ezali, yango wana sala que webcam na yo ezala connecté. Sima ya "
"détection liste ya ba webcams oyo ekoki kosalelama ekolakisama. Poná o"
"yo olingi kosalela mpe finá na Suivant."

#: src/onboarding.glade:709
msgid "Testing your webcams, please wait..."
msgstr "Komeka ba webcams na yo, svp zela..."

#: src/onboarding.glade:761
msgid "Downloading data files"
msgstr "Kozwa ba fichiers ya ba données"

#: src/onboarding.glade:780
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello needs three pre trained facial recognition datasets to be"
" able to recognise you, which will be downloaded now. You can see the "
"download progress below."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello esengeli na ba ensembles de données misato ya reconnaissa"
"nce facial pré formée po ezala na makoki ya koyeba yo, oyo eko télécha"
"rger sikoyo. Okoki komona ndenge oyo téléchargement ezali kokende na n"
"se."

#: src/onboarding.glade:801
msgid "Starting download..."
msgstr "Kobanda kozwa téléchargement..."

#: src/onboarding.glade:850
msgid "Welcome to Ubuntu Hello!"
msgstr "Boyei malamu na Ubuntu Hello!"

#: src/onboarding.glade:866
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Ya"

#: src/onboarding.glade:887
msgid ""
"This wizard will walk you through the setup process and automatically "
"configure Ubuntu Hello for you. Press next to continue."
msgstr ""
"Assistant oyo ekotambola na yo na processus ya configuration pe eko co"
"nfigurer automatiquement Ubuntu Hello pona yo. Finá pembeni mpo na kok"
"oba."

#: src/onboarding.glade:911
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Kolongola"

#: src/onboarding.glade:931
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Oyo elandi"

#: src/onboarding.glade:956
msgid "Finish setup"
msgstr "Silisa setup"

